{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"诗篇","commonName":"诗篇","title":"诗篇","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"dbc381a0d937a76da00e224516c540ebdb97b246a5380bed1b67f15a492e5440","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2452},"chapter":{"number":59,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["为安全求主施助"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["扫罗打发人窥探大卫的房屋，要杀他。那时，大卫作这金诗，交与伶长。调用休要毁坏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"我的 神啊，求你救我脱离仇敌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把我安置在高处，得脱那些起来攻击我的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你救我脱离作孽的人","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和喜爱流人血的人！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"因为，他们埋伏要害我的命；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有能力的人聚集来攻击我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华啊，这不是为我的过犯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也不是为我的罪愆。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我虽然无过，他们预备整齐，跑来攻击我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你兴起鉴察，帮助我！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万军之 神—耶和华以色列的 神啊！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你兴起，惩治万邦！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要怜悯行诡诈的恶人！ （细拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"他们晚上转回，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫号如狗，围城绕行。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们口中喷吐恶言，嘴里有刀；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们说：有谁听见？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"但你—耶和华必笑话他们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要嗤笑万邦。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的力量啊，我必仰望你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为 神是我的高台。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的 神要以慈爱迎接我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"神要叫我看见我仇敌遭报。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"不要杀他们，恐怕我的民忘记。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主啊，你是我们的盾牌；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你用你的能力使他们四散，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"且降为卑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他们口中的罪和嘴里的言语，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并咒骂虚谎的话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿他们在骄傲之中被缠住了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你发怒，使他们消灭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致归于无有，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫他们知道 神在雅各中间掌权，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到地极。 （细拉）","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"到了晚上，任凭他们转回；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"任凭他们叫号如狗，围城绕行。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必走来走去，寻找食物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若不得饱就终夜在外。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"但我要歌颂你的力量，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"早晨要高唱你的慈爱；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你作过我的高台，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我急难的日子作过我的避难所。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的力量啊，我要歌颂你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为 神是我的高台，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是赐恩与我的 神。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/59.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/60.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/PSA/58.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}